==English==

===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|fr|stagnant|}}, from {{der|en|la|stagnans|}}, present participle of {{m|la|stagno||to form a pool of standing water}}.

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Lacking [[freshness]], [[motion]], or [[flow]]; [[decay]]ing through [[stillness]].
#: {{ux|en|a '''stagnant''' pool}}
#: {{ux|en|'''stagnant''' water}}
# {{lb|en|figurative}} Without [[progress]] or [[change]]; [[stale]]; [[inactive]].
#: {{ux|en|a '''stagnant''' economy}}
#: {{ux|en|'''stagnant''' prices}}

